Lecture Detail: Full transcript, notes, flashcards, quizzes (read-only or edit)
Study Mode: Flashcard review, quiz taking (spaced repetition later)
Settings: Profile, billing, API usage
5.2 Shared Components
Build in packages/ui with React Native Web compatibility
Use react-native-web primitives or gluestack-ui/nativewind
Phase 6: Polish & Launch Prep (Week 6-8)
6.1 Exports
PDF generation: @react-pdf/renderer (works both platforms)
DOCX: docx library
Trigger via Edge Function for server-side generation
6.2 Subscription (Stripe)
Stripe Checkout portal in web app
Webhook → update users.subscription_type
Feature gating middleware
6.3 Testing & Deploy
Mobile: EAS Build → TestFlight / Play Console Internal
