Monitoring: Sentry (both platforms), Supabase logs
Key Technical Decisions
Decision	Rationale
Monorepo (Turborepo)	Shared types, components, API client; single CI
Expo (not bare RN)	Faster iteration, OTA updates, managed workflow
Supabase Edge Functions	Colocated with DB, no separate server infra
Whisper API → self-host	Start fast, optimize cost later
React Query + Supabase Realtime	Optimistic updates, live transcript
NativeWind (Tailwind)	Shared styling system across web/mobile
Risk Mitigation
Risk	Mitigation
Audio recording background limits (iOS)	Foreground service, local notification, test extensively
Transcription accuracy	Post-process with LLM cleanup, user edit capability
AI cost overruns	Rate limiting, usage tracking, hard caps per tier
Solo dev burnout	Strict scope, weekly milestones, defer "AI Tutor" to v2